        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write how you are today and where you are now. Then write the same about two other people.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Say aloud how you feel and where you are at four different moments of a normal day."
